#: ../../source/setup/session_storage.rst:4
msgid "Session storage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/setup/session_storage.rst:5
msgid "*Choose where to keep your files and where to run temporary work*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/setup/session_storage.rst:7
msgid ""
"Every SEPAL session gives you access to two kinds of storage: your **home"
" folder**, which is kept between sessions, and a **temporary disk**, "
"which belongs to the session and is emptied when it stops. Choosing the "
"right one makes your work faster and keeps your storage quota for the "
"files you need."
msgstr ""

